CORE
instance_array1.sv
--bound 1
^\[main\.s\[0\]\.p0\] always main\.s\[0\]\.bus\.v == 4'b0101: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.s\[1\]\.p0\] always main\.s\[1\]\.bus\.v == 4'b0101: PROVED up to bound 1$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Per 1800-2017 23.3.3, an interface instance that is connected to an
interface port of an instance array is connected to every element of the
array.
